{
  "_note": "现在 · 一行(21 · 迷你档,card-design-system §8.1):城市 + 时效锚;气温 + 天况 / 高低温。不放天况图标:3 位数华氏(104°)会压到图标,而图标让出位置后英文天况(Thunderstorm / Partly cloudy)又放不下;天况文字 + 天空底已说清。第二行右栏:正在下雨 > 几点起有雨 > 今日高低(与 today 的 tipKey 同一判据:rainNow / rainFlag)。天空底、图标、色值取自 now.rcn。数据 = weather.df,不新增请求。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_skyNote",
          "value": "0"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_sky",
          "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${sky},overcast)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_decor",
          "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${decor},fog)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},clear)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#2F7FC4\\,#6FB4E0\\,#A9D2EC)@90|linear(#1F5C90\\,#487F9E\\,#6E9AB0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},overcast)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#6B7E8E\\,#93A5B2\\,#B9C6CF)@90|linear(#4A5763\\,#6A7783\\,#8A96A0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},rain)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#3E5A73\\,#5C7B93\\,#89A3B5)@90|linear(#2A3F52\\,#42596C\\,#647D8C)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},snow)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#7C93A8\\,#A8BCCB\\,#D6E3EC)@90|linear(#586A7A\\,#7B8D9B\\,#9FB0BC)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},night)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#101A2E\\,#1C2A44\\,#33465F)@90|linear(#0A1220\\,#141F33\\,#25344A)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_decor},glow)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "radial(#8CFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.8\\,0.16\\,0.6|radial(#66FFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.8\\,0.16\\,0.6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_decor},fog)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "radial(#2BFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.5\\,0.34\\,0.78|radial(#1EFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.5\\,0.34\\,0.78"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#00000000\\,#4D000000)@90|linear(#00000000\\,#59000000)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "srcDot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "10pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#7FC4F5|#7FC4F5",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "19pt",
        "y": "9pt",
        "w": "90pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${city},--)]",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "113pt",
        "y": "10.5pt",
        "w": "35pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "_note": "时效锚(§3):右上角 / 9pt / 右缘 148。天空底上次级灰读不出,与 22 档同用 70% 白(检查器 ALLOW 例外)。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${temp},--),--),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "id": "t",
            "y": "24pt",
            "text": "${temp}°"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${temp},--),--),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "id": "tE",
            "y": "30pt",
            "text": "--"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${group},clear)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "68pt",
            "y": "24pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.cond_clear}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${group},partly)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "68pt",
            "y": "24pt",
            "w": "80pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.cond_partly}",
